  {
    "id": "044072ac-c017-4cf9-8c2a-f9f58f139ed9",
    "title": "PheraCam",
    "slug": "pheracam",
    "description": "\nPheraCAM is an AI-based security and protection System that uses facial recognition and edge computing to alert you when an unregistered face is detected, causing you to take necessary actions when your property is posed to a threat.",
    "tags": [],
    "featured": false,
    "liveUrl": "https://phera-cam.vercel.app/",
    "codeUrl": "https://github.com/pidoxy/pheraCAM",
    "youtubeUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bUmzASxRi6E",
    "body": [
      {
        "_key": "7768a0eee790",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "f575eadcb152",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "# PheraCam"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "dc16c07fd146",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "100db68682ee",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "[live demo](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bUmzASxRi6E)"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "0bd4fe192fd7",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "1e3faa111c13",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "## Problem Statement\nThe insecurity in Nigeria is increasing exponentially with each passing day.\nInsecurity and terrorism have been a major challenge for the Nigerians and\nthe government lately, each of which leads to the loss of properties and the\ndestruction of properties. Lack of working systems has led to high crime rate\nwithout penalty for crimes ,there are even cases of the wrong individual\naccused for crimes they did not commit."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "5f449b9e7735",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "775ab2db69da",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Which brings us to the big question"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "580b23fddd3c",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "a91e83de28ff",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "How might we us solve Insecurity?"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "0617a26e773c",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "fb090ab5d343",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "## Concept"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "470f9b96b696",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "e288db2b8bc4",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Our concept is based on"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "973df35ffb03",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "6ef2830b6d2c",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "* THEME: Accelerating Artificial Intelligence & big data through edge computing <img width=\"1440\" alt=\"Screenshot 2022-06-11 at 20 42 16\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/56538561/173213046-5249e165-b28b-4a21-868d-5cc202f365e6.png\">"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "9365619e4923",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "8b2daed4da38",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "and"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "56a5910ec5c6",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "8ca560442ac3",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "* SUB THEME: Internet of things at the edge"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "c0a87d1e7213",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b989caa9e5e5",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "### Our Solution"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "958184fe8eb7",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "f26cd28101dd",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "PheraCAM is an AI-Based Security and protection System that uses\nfacial recognition and edge computing to alert you when\nan unregistered face is detected, causing you to make\nnecessary actions when your property is pose to a threat."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "89340c1e9f44",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "6cb1384b57f3",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Everyone wants to be secured or let’s say have some sort\nof security including our users.\nOur users build wealth to be able to have some level of\nsecurity and we are using this product to give our users\nby exploring the effective use of face recognition in our day\nto day to protect your property against theft and crime."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "88b4a75107a1",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "345e4ee680c7",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Hence, we can make our users sleep better at night."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "5bdaa3e1100d",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "9d4f661a6e29",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "## How The Solution Works"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "830478f1eeb9",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "15d088956066",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "A basic flow is our cameras(sensors) pick up raw data and transact with the cloud\nfor edge speed processing and then return data to the web app where the user can\naccess"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "49afd6bc49e3",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "42e3724185f0",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "## Tech Stack\n* Figma: https://www.figma.com/file/rvSBK8LCxLlWcfIAJjv2kb/pheraCAM?node-id=267%3A705\n* React\n* Python\n* Azure\n* Netlify"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "3fc0fb8ba17b",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "5c1f6a4c5436",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
